flowchart LR
    Visitor[زائر] -->|تصفح| Catalog[Catalog API]
    Catalog --> DB[(PostgreSQL)]
    Visitor -->|إضافة للسلة| Cart[Cart API]
    Cart --> Redis[(Redis)]
    Visitor -->|Checkout| Orders[Orders API]
    Orders --> DB
    Orders -->|طلب دفع| Payments[Payments API]
    Payments -->|Outbound| Gateway[Stripe / شام كاش]
    Gateway -->|Webhook Inbound| Payments
    Payments -->|تحديث الحالة| DB
    Payments -->|إشعار| Notifications[Notifications]
    Admin[مدير المنصة] -->|CRUD| Catalog
    Admin -->|تحديث الحالة| Orders
